  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed dwelling by reason of its siting, being located forward from the established built line, and design would result in the appearance of an overly dominant , elongated dwelling, resulting in an incongruous addition to the street scene.&nbsp;As such, the proposal is contrary to:Paragraphs 131 and 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework (December 2023)Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policy CP3 of the Local Development Framework (LDF) Core Strategy (July 2010)Policy BP11 of the Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough Wide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011)Policies SP2, DMD1, and DMD6 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Draft Local Plan (Regulation 19 Main Modifications Version, December 2021)",
    "The proposed dwelling by reasons of its position, proximity, scale, massing, and height would cause a loss of outlook and harm to residential amenity by virtue of providing an overbearing structure.&nbsp;As such, the proposal is contrary to:Paragraph 135(f) of the National Planning Policy Framework (December 2023)Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies BP8 and BR11 of the Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough Wide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011)"
  ],
